Created `Services/FileSystemWrapper.cs`. It's a delegating wrapper around `IFileSystem` — all members are `virtual`, so you can subclass it and override only what you need:

```csharp
public class SandboxedFileSystem : FileSystemWrapper
{
    public SandboxedFileSystem(IFileSystem inner) : base(inner) { }

    public override IFile File => /* custom logic */;
}
```

It exposes all `IFileSystem` surface area: `File`, `Directory`, `FileInfo`, `FileStream`, `Path`, `DirectoryInfo`, `DriveInfo`, and `FileSystemWatcher`.
